{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22155","headline":"首夏病间 · 白居易","name":"首夏病间","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我生来几时，万有四千日。\n自省於其间，非忧即有疾。\n老去虑渐息，年来病初愈。\n忽喜身与心，泰然两无苦。\n况兹孟夏月，清和好时节。\n微风吹裌衣，不寒复不热。\n移榻树阴下，竟日何所爲。\n或饮一瓯茗，或吟两句诗。\n内无忧患迫，外无职役羁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}